\newlabel{fig:angled-throw-train}{{3}{5}{Training of the neural network in SBI from the example of an angled throw. The network learns to map the dataset of tuples $(\theta _i,x_i)$ to the estimated posterior density $q_\phi (\theta _i|x_i)$. The example and parts of the figure are adapted from \cite {sbi-guide}}{figure.caption.3}{}}
