\newlabel{fig:angled-throw-posterior}{{4}{5}{Estimated posteriors distributions $q_\phi (\theta |x_\text {obs})$ achieved with SBI from the example of an angled throw. The trained neural network was sampled at the specified $x_\text {obs}$ values and evaluated in a $\theta $-intervall between $0^\circ $ and $90^\circ $. The example is adapted from \cite {sbi-guide}}{figure.caption.4}{}}
